---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ContactBand from "../components/ContactBand.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Online Counselling"
	description="Online counselling by telephone or video with a BACP-registered counsellor. As effective as face-to-face counselling, from the comfort of your own home."
>
	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Online Counselling</h1>
			<p class="lead page-lead">
				Counselling offered via telephone or video technology &mdash; the same care,
				from wherever you are.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="split">
				<div>
					<h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.4rem">Who is it for?</h2>
				</div>
				<div class="prose">
					<p>
						I have offered online counselling since the pandemic, and for clients
						who prefer this option to face-to-face counselling. The reasons might be
						that they live too far away from my practice, or that they prefer
						counselling from the comfort of their own home.
					</p>
					<p>
						People who don&rsquo;t like going to new places &mdash; or those who
						can&rsquo;t leave the house for other reasons, such as illness or
						difficulty finding childcare &mdash; also choose to access support
						remotely.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-alt">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="split">
				<div>
					<h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.4rem">How effective is online counselling?</h2>
				</div>
				<div class="prose">
					<p>
						Many studies show that online counselling is at least as effective as
						face-to-face counselling. A 2013 study found that online counselling
						clients were more likely than not to experience continued engagement
						with the issues they worked on in therapy.
					</p>
					<p>
						Studies also find that the increase in written correspondence offers
						people the chance to review and reflect on issues more consistently.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="split">
				<div>
					<h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.4rem">How does it work?</h2>
				</div>
				<div class="prose">
					<p>
						There are a number of options we can explore to find the best fit for
						you. Some people prefer a phone call, finding it less distracting than a
						video call. Others like the visual connection of Skype, FaceTime or
						WhatsApp.
					</p>
					<ul class="issues" aria-label="Ways we can meet online">
						<li>Phone</li>
						<li>Skype</li>
						<li>FaceTime</li>
						<li>WhatsApp</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						I will work with you to find a way that helps you feel connected, heard
						and understood.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<ContactBand
		sub="Not sure whether online is for you? I&rsquo;ll help you find a way that feels right."
	/>
</BaseLayout>
